<section>
<title>Detailed Description</title>

<para>Class <link linkend="_class_win32_ps">Win32Ps</link></para>

<para>This class provides various utility functions for interacting with Windows processes. It includes methods for retrieving process information, checking process existence, finding processes by PID or path, and terminating processes. </para>
